  "notes": "Cash basis county, governmental funds only (no business-type funds; fiduciary funds not in trim). Statement lines from Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Ending cash = Cash and Cash Equivalents 510,292 (p3); no prior-year cash printed, so beginning_cash null; fund balances 783,278 / 510,292 recorded in fund balance fields (p4); roll-forward ties. Taxes: Other 45,524 split: Visitor Promotion + Visitor Improvement fund Other taxes 37,116 (lodging tax by fund name, p13/p15) and General Fund 8,408 (p4). Public Works statement line includes Road Fund 894,047 and noxious weed 53,667 (dominant: streets/highways). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p5; Taxes split by p4 General Fund column), major fund budget schedules (p6-8; ARPA disbursements split by function per p4 column), nonmajor funds from the combining statement (p13-15, more detailed than the one-line nonmajor budget schedules on p9-12, so those are not recorded; Drug Law Enforcement, Law Enforcement Grant and Disaster funds had no actual activity). Zero-actual lines skipped. Read pages 1-15 of 15"
